  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>김정식 선생님 프로그램을 띄워서</p><p>화면녹화기로 실시간 녹화를 해보았어요.</p><p><br></p></div><p><iframe id=\"vcde28r8Quvz8rQffkrzuQk\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vcde28r8Quvz8rQffkrzuQk?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZjZGUyOHI4UXV2ejhyUWZma3J6dVFrIiwidGlkIjoiYzZlYjIzYzAtYzAxYS00NmVmLWEwYTEtNTFmNTE3NzFmMGJkIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg0MjIyfQ.0d5hhz9nUyZUuxzHVa2TlW041SEmRRKcqnH6RP09hscPctUA7BEU2Kw9CdA_1QmzUJ6wyuThZ1I1TcCNpTyROg&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v398036ZpW360QMwwZQW6im\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v398036ZpW360QMwwZQW6im?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InYzOTgwMzZacFczNjBRTXd3WlFXNmltIiwidGlkIjoiZjE0MGJjNWEtNjkxMi00NmIyLThhZmQtM2IxZDQwODc0MTcxIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg0MjIyfQ.vrrQB21UJ5U1qEzsPW5kQpuKg81vUf9obMcwnR_9ClcSVZUtnluq3YxUknxEWcHKA_RbTjetVnKWBTXcr_jymg&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v853621e8e8d